      "config_path": "population.epidemic_seed.stage_distribution.value.Chronic",
      "min": 0.0,
      "max": 0.40,
      "distribution": "uniform",
      "unit": "proportion",
      "notes": "V13.7 simplex parameter. Runner injects stage_distribution in memory; config_path is descriptive. Widened after initial pilot stop so the calibration can test more mature non-AIDS seed without forcing direct AIDS-stage entry.",
      "stages": ["joint"]
    },
    {
